{"version":1,"key":"card:780","content":{"id":780,"content":[{"collabId":"453cca3a-5423-4f72-8515-1e991f8fe1b7","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们经常会在开发启动应用时遇到端口被占用的情况。通常可能是在其他命令行窗口启动了服务，但是忘记了关掉，一时之间也不知道在那个命令行窗口，这是我们迫切需要找到这个进程，然后杀掉。"}]},{"collabId":"9ae19a43-5a1e-4ee2-88e0-e86cc09ab208","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可是我们只知道端口号，那么怎么"},{"collabId":"a1ddb466-229e-46e9-9ae5-142fa9bc9c35","contentId":427,"contentTitle":"Windows 下杀死占用端口的进程","contentType":"card","refId":501,"type":"content-link","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"根据端口号找到进程"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"呢？"}]},{"collabId":"2c5edeb8-375f-45b4-a364-f11c64654458","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"lsof"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的命令，它的作用是查看进程打开的文件，网络套接字也被认为是文件的一种，因此可以根据此命令找到端口对应的信息。"}]},{"collabId":"22a06e61-8533-42c0-8d2f-593e73378744","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最简单的用法如下："}]},{"collabId":"2f1741d2-3dc4-4389-accc-60578a98cb81","language":"Shell","type":"code-block","uuid":"51bc720d-8366-49c9-a2dd-0d429d77184b","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"lsof -t -i:端口号"},{"collabId":"7fd93a8d-cd28-4a21-b39e-2820acedf4e7","type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"collabId":"9d13aa30-2a7a-48c0-b197-b3a7121e7f66","type":"list-item","children":[{"collabId":"41cf31fc-00af-4ab4-a6d8-fd44b74748d8","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"-i:端口号"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，按端口筛选网络连接"}]}]},{"collabId":"566138aa-c09e-4f67-b0db-44db05ab14f6","type":"list-item","children":[{"collabId":"0db35286-396b-4a50-a07c-f708277bb4cc","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"-t"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，只输出进程的 "},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"PID"}]}]}]},{"collabId":"f2fb01da-6773-4007-a698-09873cf86484","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":":端口号 是 -i"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的网络地址筛选参数，必须与 "},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"-i"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 连写。例如查找占用 "},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"5137"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 端口的进程："}]},{"collabId":"b8efffcc-fa1d-43d3-b5e8-b86d7063077e","language":"Shell","type":"code-block","uuid":"9c7bc983-7e10-460a-a58d-8adf29d3272c","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"lsof -t -i:5137\nHello World"},{"collabId":"7f412654-631a-4b94-a13b-58428b5f8ca9","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当经常我们发现可能存在多个输出"}]},{"collabId":"de3ccf02-84e4-4599-9b49-aaf44acc507d","language":"Shell","type":"code-block","uuid":"c25fc0c8-0524-441d-af0f-5fcc447eafff","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"lsof -t -i :5173\n31360\n42262\n98845"},{"collabId":"385dd78d-ef6e-4ae8-9d97-7815999eb7a0","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这是因为有多个进程涉及这个端口，这些进程可能正在监听这个断开，也可能是与该服务建立连接的其他进程，这是可以通过 "},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"-sTCP:LISTEN"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 找到监听这个端口的进程："}]},{"collabId":"1079595a-f2d3-4dcc-9237-30cbd538c109","language":"Shell","type":"code-block","uuid":"aed7cd98-329e-4237-aee0-836c4c4460ec","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"lsof -t -i:5173 -sTCP:LISTEN\n42262"},{"collabId":"22c5f7e6-e73e-4021-b5cc-844d611c5be9","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"确认 "},{"code":true,"type":"formatted","text":"PID"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 后，可以先尝试正常结束进程："}]},{"collabId":"28ee236d-f58d-4cf2-b3d0-2747d0005382","language":"Shell","type":"code-block","uuid":"c7b9363f-c88e-40eb-afb1-35ac83bad696","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"kill PID"},{"collabId":"71700b02-8ea8-4398-ad42-72d8ecf5bde9","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果进程没有退出，再使用强制结束："}]},{"collabId":"b643984e-ed9e-4bee-bb75-df9aa0f7befc","language":"Shell","type":"code-block","uuid":"d7f05281-f2d3-43e5-b4fb-604fb707f649","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"kill -9 PID"},{"collabId":"232ee306-be7f-4a74-abbf-d383bb21d696","disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"也可以组合执行，但执行前应确认命令确实找到了目标进程："}]},{"collabId":"b8bcbe76-4b03-4c9e-b786-30b9c13be8dd","language":"Shell","type":"code-block","uuid":"406ccdc4-baf3-4e66-800e-2e70c6b6acf5","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"kill -9 $(lsof -t -i:端口号 -sTCP:LISTEN)"}],"tags":["技巧"],"createTime":1788512316121,"updateTime":1791476571504,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1791476571504},"links":{"card:501":{"key":"card:501","type":"card","id":501}}}